{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_title", "source_sha256": "15c6123a3009a4d929f5a03d3dd6486e4a828001696c8993e8778ae3a31a556b", "ja": "新しい友達", "zh": "新朋友", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_synopsis", "source_sha256": "80af9b7d99d41e07c7abbe9dcd374009f10cb3c52e13e6bbcc8ece11f3177580", "ja": "新聞部の亜利沙からあずさとの関係について\n質問攻めにあう育。そこを助けれてくれた\n隣のクラスの星梨花、昴とも仲良くなる。\n放課後、海美とも仲良くなれないのだろうか\nと考えていた育はあずさから呼び出される。", "zh": "育被新闻部的亚利沙围绕与梓的关系问个不停。帮她解围的隔壁班星梨花，以及昴，也和她成了好朋友。\n放学后，正想着不知道能不能也和海美成为好朋友的育，被梓叫了过去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1000_030iku", "source_sha256": "1586c816a9ca5125228b2760546d531caee1d8101116752ed0f6291be05587bc", "ja": "ひなたさん、さっきは本当にありがとう。\n助かっちゃった。", "zh": "日向小姐，刚才真的谢谢你。帮大忙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "06d030453ee99aefaed1934d1fc2a1cefe94df2ceae05c8b744efeef1e0d3ba5", "ja": "どういたしまして。それで育さん、\n海美さんのことだけども……。", "zh": "不客气。对了，育，关于海美……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "28d672287a84b5ab2065ba8bf27c45428d775669cbe3402a10ee8dd1b6e2d2f6", "ja": "中谷育さん、新聞部です！", "zh": "中谷育同学，这里是新闻部！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "0701ed359a053319676652814bbfa40c9440331ba725bbfc4b2c4ce8d59713f0", "ja": "きゃああああっ！！？", "zh": "呀啊啊啊啊！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "0701ed359a053319676652814bbfa40c9440331ba725bbfc4b2c4ce8d59713f0", "ja": "きゃああああっ！！？", "zh": "呀啊啊啊啊！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "9721b9eead39db2d0f6996fe0ed0c0bd4547d50dbbd18678a2f7e45877c770cf", "ja": "ずばり！　率直にお聞きしますが、\nミス・ラベンダーとはどんなご関係で！？", "zh": "直截了当地问您一句，您和薰衣草小姐究竟是什么关系！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "fbcb46a4d0f86ea9919aa47f730a5a9ff4a99f04305a46dbe4d488f9a60eae8d", "ja": "え？　あ、あの、あずさお姉ちゃんとわたしは、\n幼なじみで……。", "zh": "诶？啊，那个，梓姐姐和我是青梅竹马……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "9f4235a89f66442d4c53e60fd1489251d8f00b138a17db38ba37813991e1ec78", "ja": "幼なじみ！？　これは特ダネですっ。全校生徒のため、\n深く掘り下げる必要がありそうですねぇ……ムフフ♪", "zh": "青梅竹马！？这可是独家新闻。为了全校学生，\n似乎很有必要深入挖掘一番呢……嘿嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "a780900387bb4365133cb8d8dfb638ee8803480746285a271cda62bd1a651bc8", "ja": "あ、あの、その辺にしてもらえませんか……？\n人には、言いにくい事もあると思うので……。", "zh": "啊、那个，能不能先到此为止……？\n我觉得，人总有些难以启齿的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "450026cce239f1dee287f629d99029023d182b1251f24a66921e4a32a8eb0e31", "ja": "そこを探るのが我々の仕事なのです！　血液型は！？\nお誕生日は！？　体はどこから洗いますか～っ！？", "zh": "探究这些正是我们的工作！血型是！？生日是哪天！？洗澡时会先从哪里开始洗呀～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "1d4d14465622a7e95f38deb804523237e659b576456b90a77974cc2ad1a45b57", "ja": "あっ！　窓の外を見てみろ！\n空飛ぶジャコウウシが群れをなしてるぞ！", "zh": "啊！快看窗外！\n有一群麝牛在天上飞呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "e2e10933505f209f150949b20f5acdcbe1ec8fd81ecb2148d00000881f280f6b", "ja": "えっ！？　シャッターチャンス……って、そんなわけ\nないでしょう！　極寒地帯にいる動物なんですから！", "zh": "诶！？拍照的好机会……才怪吧！那可是生活在极寒地带的动物啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "52d40d5dcfd1f1355ec25495536e66ee1a45db6bc23ddd90312003259239400f", "ja": "ちぇっ、ダマされなかったかぁ。", "zh": "啧，没骗到你啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "c01c0166e932ce55ad71a9c538301a32567d5c8386e9ba7a6eea0b6fe70baaf6", "ja": "亜利沙お姉さま……姿が見えないと思ったら、\nこんなところにいらしたんですね！", "zh": "亚利沙姐姐……刚才还奇怪怎么没看到您，原来您在这里呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "5feac4521aedb4ed1b35a835ee9cf4aa915b6b7f2c27800f85ff5c3d01d54706", "ja": "ヒェッ、こ、このみさん！？　これはその、\nジャーナリズム精神に則った取材というか……。", "zh": "呃、这、这不是小此木姐！？这是那个，秉持新闻精神进行的采访……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "5a1ad3dd66a75121cd38b85c554979a20825741f0a557f536a7fa53c32c59cfd", "ja": "1年生のクラスにまで押しかけて、後輩たちを\nおびえさせることがですか……？", "zh": "跑到1年级的班级里，去吓唬后辈们\n也算吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "18b07ba9004ea8eac539fb678b10634ddf5b3d7a7abcedb2ea5c02354f4bfc02", "ja": "あなたたち、ごめんなさいね。この先輩の言うことは\n気にしなくて平気だから。さ、行きますよ！", "zh": "你们，真是抱歉。这位前辈说的话不用在意。来，我们走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "6655c0edd4a918f8d1612b390b73dbca8a86760d0dd8a6da97bb00346fd167e4", "ja": "ま、待ってください！　ありさはあくまで\n全校生徒の興味のために働くべく……ああっ！", "zh": "等、请等一下！亚利沙完全是\n为了全校学生的兴趣才去行动的……啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "8184f8fee301c5ca59030468cc05ca864e6464843e014b4ecee066152e83d15b", "ja": "行っちゃったみたいですね……。\nあの、大丈夫でしたか？", "zh": "她好像走了……。\n请问，你没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "c101f98937fe20940a10905f69e28881e915d9961cf8ee90e7e21a3b5b7ea3f6", "ja": "さすがに、びっくりするよなー。\n転校してきたばっかで、あんな風に質問攻めされたら。", "zh": "那种情况确实会吓一跳吧——\n刚转学过来就被那样连番追问。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "b6187ac1a02c42c4f58a2398b7052f099b6c4599dba07abdddfff3d579d1ee8c", "ja": "あ、自己紹介が遅れましたわ！\nオレ……じゃなくて、わたしは永吉昴。よろしく！", "zh": "啊，自我介绍晚了！\n我……不对，我是永吉昴。请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "9364aad3aeaca667b5aad712d1f40617aa1529db8ac4c383e9dbb9e12222233d", "ja": "箱崎星梨花です。転校生の中谷育さん……ですよね？\nわたし達隣のクラスなんです。仲良くしてくださいね♪", "zh": "我是箱崎星梨花。你是转校生中谷育，对吧？我们在隔壁班。请和我好好相处哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1022_030iku", "source_sha256": "b4d62f52b53242bb5f1d63b3ee01d70dd79e1fcae96fe103bdc57b9e5ddc4e2f", "ja": "うん、こちらこそ！　わからない事ばかり\nだから、色々教えてほしいな♪", "zh": "嗯，我也是！因为还有好多不明白的事情，所以想请你教教我♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "484a5681932dd9f4d3cd90bd3f10a6a4f7ebaa5b6c351666b49689b7352d93d5", "ja": "それじゃあ、今日のお昼はみんなで食べようか？\nきっと、仲良くなれるよぉ♪", "zh": "那么，今天中午大家一起吃饭吧？\n这样一定能和大家变得要好哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1024_null", "source_sha256": "f15646b13b9f99fca4055ea9f9c4e7c45f92d5400293db167ef0ac2ecf5690da", "ja": "放課後……", "zh": "放学后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1025_030iku", "source_sha256": "924dbbf957720f857056523e98c60a5c5614cb73efc59aa2a160107608e8e2e7", "ja": "ひなたさんに昴さんに、星梨花さん。えへへ、\nまだ1日目なのに、友達がたくさん出来ちゃった♪", "zh": "日向、昴、星梨花。嘿嘿，明明才第1天，就已经交到好多朋友了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1026_030iku", "source_sha256": "f01731c77a6f23b4ebe01cc2b0e87e59f87e8ad09d0ab4df58aaf709de0cab62", "ja": "さっきの人……高坂海美さん、って言ったっけ。\nあの人とも、仲良くなれないのかな……。", "zh": "刚才那个人……是叫高坂海美小姐吧。\n不知道能不能也和她成为好朋友……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1027_seitokaistudent", "source_sha256": "bdacd6b872dfb08176bbed37435bfe98d5d5c0da5c0cf0c1e04e76cb70661745", "ja": "ああ、いたいた。中谷育さん？　生徒会長……\nミス・ラベンダーが、生徒会室まで来てほしいって。", "zh": "啊，找到你了。是中谷育同学吗？学生会长……\n薰衣草小姐说，希望你到学生会室去一趟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_11_1028_030iku", "source_sha256": "013a4102c31d6305b15cedb30439124768a2b3d32ae24e57056ca797339d63f9", "ja": "は、はい。\n生徒会長……あずさお姉ちゃんが？", "zh": "好、好的。\n学生会长……是梓姐姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
